This extension is a port of Netgen Admin UI to Exponential 6 template code. It contains files copied unchanged
from Netgen Admin UI and the libraries it ships, as installed from the Composer package se7enxweb/admin-ui-bundle
2.9.15 (a fork of netgen/admin-ui-bundle, https://github.com/netgen/NetgenAdminUIBundle). doc/ASSETS.md lists
every copied file with its source path and sha256.

